### report working via OSC 7501
$ <run-root>/bin/hc send sh1 printf '\e]7501;state=working:app=smoke:progress=10\e\\'
--- stdout
{"started":null,"status":null,"turn":0}
--- stderr
--- exit=0 elapsed_ms=215

