### send while blocked (expect refusal exit 9)
$ <run-root>/bin/hc send sh1 echo SHOULD_BE_REFUSED
--- stdout
--- stderr
{"error":{"hint":"typing would answer its dialog; read its screen first (hc read t1), or --force","kind":"blocked","message":"t1 is blocked (permission)"}}
--- exit=9 elapsed_ms=13

### send --force while blocked
$ <run-root>/bin/hc send --force sh1 printf '\e]7501;state=done:app=smoke\e\\'
--- stdout
{"started":false,"status":"blocked","turn":1}
--- stderr
--- exit=0 elapsed_ms=5213

